abstract: "Work in Progress — Academic Research Resource. A curated catalogue of GIS, cartography and Earth-observation resources, access routes, interpretation limits and proposed dataset-level metadata. Provider descriptions are not end-to-end validation of every platform. Repository public accessibility remains unverified. No licence has been selected for this repository or its research documentation; public accessibility and citation metadata do not grant reuse permissions. Third-party resources retain their own reuse conditions."
